WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.950
Here, in its natural habitat...

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.940
...the pre-med student.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:06.320
Fourth lap of the Krebs cycle tonight.

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:08.900
It has highlighted the entire page.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.950
A bold strategy.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.220
But this one has adapted.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.350
Cards it misses come back sooner.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.100
Cards it knows... wait longer.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:17.900
It feeds every evening...

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.350
...and forages between lectures.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.300
BioRecall. A remarkable adaptation.
